5385_6754779820263262580_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1b9gcxzv_CwQ7kNvwGTw6xR&_nc_oc=Adp9QLfuFnb77-lTcwzmV6FDT50a42JdnA18au3QaW42b0k96taRH4MhpaMPMEqte3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4F5CPbshW6MJqWYAzAzQVYYzg64N1C122o3bWzCqlE0g&oe=6A1EDBFE"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00003.png", "id": "2980406862295700", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_2980406865629033_7800056063099286803_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53aXtEsiUoUQ7kNvwEPr1V7&_nc_oc=AdqbcqbMarjbeQH-k7obuyDgj4k2t2PyYnKcV001Q271QDl5UQbWGNqKd54IYnzzFEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6oGUOgCinzFfZsz9YOFk3SwTnuY_cdlJFHitFZBwZ_5w&oe=6A1EE104"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Air Conditioner Maintenance", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Air Conditioner Maintenance is an immersive VR training application developed to simulate real-world AC servicing and maintenance procedures. Through interactive scenarios, learners gain practical experience in inspection, troubleshooting, cleaning, and system handling\u2014helping build confidence and job-ready skills in a safe virtual setting.\n\nThis application is an integral component of the Immerse Learn Air Conditioner Maintenance micro-credential program. It is not a standalone product\u2014only individuals officially enrolled in the program will have access. The VR experience is designed to complement structured learning, allowing users to apply theoretical knowledge through guided, hands-on practice.\n\nIdeal for workforce training and skill development, this application helps bridge the gap between learning and real-world performance using advanced immersive technology.", "short_description": "Air Conditioner Maintenance is a VR training application designed for immersive, hands-on skill development. This app is part of the Immerse Learn Air Conditioner Maintenance micro-credenti